# Licence

Copyright (c) 2026 Jakob Persson

This project is released under two licences, because it is two kinds of work.
MIT is written for software and reads oddly when applied to prose, so the
written material is licensed separately. The practical effect is the same in
both cases: attribution is the only condition.

