## A note on the engineering

The formulas and physical constants themselves are not anyone's property, and
nothing here claims otherwise. What is licensed is the particular expression:
the wording of the explanations, the choice and arrangement of material, and
the code that implements the calculations.

Every calculation on this site is a simplified model. Check anything
consequential against the relevant standard or a primary source.
